                <pb facs="0343" n="263" sameAs="frus:frus1936v01/pg263"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.0011 Mutual Guarantee (Locarno)/471:
                    Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Minister in
                        Norway</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Biddle</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1936-03-21T13:00:00-05:00">March 21, 1936—1
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>6. We have greatly appreciated your 20, March 18 because of its timeliness,
                    accuracy, and conciseness. Your 21, March 20, has also been read with interest.
                    Further brief, telegraphic reports of this nature would be welcome.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Phillips</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
